# MLB-LAB Baseline

## Repository

- Canonical branch: `main`
- Operational snapshot: `PROJECT_STATE.md` (prefer over stale docs)

## Canonical deployed architecture (G0b static export)

MLB/Statcast → `scripts/build_daily_export.py` → validation/promotion →
`daily_export.json` → Vite/React (`web-dashboard/`) → Cloudflare Pages

FastAPI/SQLite is **not** the canonical deployed architecture. Treat `BUILD_PLAN.md` FastAPI paths as aspirational unless a decision reopens them.

## Do not without explicit authorization

- Delete or redirect `/legacy/*` routes (DEC-001)
- Fabricate Top Plays / Category Boards when export arrays are empty (DEC-005)
- Change export schemas, promotion policy (DEC-002), or `.gitignore`
- Remote deploy or merge branches
- Promote `evidence/**/*.raw.json` to test fixtures (DEC-006)

## Evidence

- Raw captures: `evidence/**/*.raw.json` — local only (gitignored)
- Metadata may be committed in general (DEC-006), but do not stage/commit evidence files unless the task explicitly names them (e.g. `evidence/mlb/game-995731-feed-live.metadata.txt` remains untracked by default)

## Generated artifacts

Do not commit: `data/daily_export.json`, `web-dashboard/dist/`, export candidates/backups (see `.gitignore`, `docs/DEPLOYMENT.md`).
